          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu mwanace jwa Yabeshi ŵajinjile ucimwene mu caka ca 39 ca ucimwene wa Usiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda, nipo ŵalamulile kwa mwesi umope ku Samaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu mwanace jwa Gadi, ŵatyosile ku Tilisa kuja ku Samaliya, ŵamwuleje Mwenye Shalumu mwanace jwa Yabeshi, ni ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe. Ŵandu ŵa mu msinda wa Tapuwa nganasaka kumpikanila jwalakwe, nipo jwalakwe ŵawujonasile msindawo pamo ni misinda josope jakusyungulila, mpaka ku Tilisa. Ŵawuleje ŵandu wosope ŵa mu msinda ŵa Tapuwa, ŵawuleje pakwatumbulanya acakongwe ŵaŵakwete yili, ni upanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14+2KI.15.15+2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14",
              "2KI.15.15",
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yosope yiŵatesile Mwenye Shalumu, ni ya malindi yiŵatesile, yosopeyi yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14+2KI.15.15+2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14",
              "2KI.15.15",
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Menahemu mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14+2KI.15.15+2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14",
              "2KI.15.15",
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mcaka ca 39 ca ucimwene wa Asaliya mwenye jwa ku Yuda, Menahemu mwanace jwa Gadi ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli, nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka likumi ali ku Samaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manahemu ŵatesile yindu yakusakala ya kwalemwecesya AMBUJE. Jwalakwe nganaleka kutenda yakusakala yiŵatendaga Yelobowamu mwanace jwa Nebati, yele yiŵalemwekasisye nayo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, kwa umi wakwe wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ndaŵi ja ucimwene ŵa Mwenye Manahemu, Tigilati Pilesa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, ŵayice kuputa ngondo ku Isalaeli. Mwenye Tigilati Pilesa ŵajiticisye kumkamucisya pa kumjonjecesya Menahimu macili gakulamulila cilambo cakwe, naga Menahimujo akupeleka makilogalamu 34,000 ga silifa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahimu ŵasipatile mbiyasyo kutyocela kwa ŵandu ŵakusicila ŵa ku Isalaeli, ŵaŵalamwile kupeleka masekeli 50 ga silifa mundu jwalijose, nipo piŵasisongenye syele mbiyasyo, ŵasipelece mbiya syosopesyo kwa Tigilati Pilesa. Jwalakwe piŵasipocele mbiyasyo ŵawujile ku cilambo ca kumangwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
