              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka ŵatesile yindu yakusakala ya kwalemwecesya AMBUJE. Jwalakwe nganaleka kutenda yindu yakusakala yiŵatendaga Yelobowamu mwanace jwa Nebati yiŵalemwekasisye nayo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
