          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka mwanace jwa Lemaliya, juŵaliji jwamkulungwa jwakwe jwa asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa Peka, ŵamtendele malindi Peka, pamo ni ŵandu 50 ŵa ku Giliyadi ni ŵamwuleje Peka mkati mwa cipinda ca mkati ca nyumba ja ucimwene ku Samaliya, nipo jwalakwejo ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
