              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ndaŵi jiŵalamulilaga Peka, Mwenye Tigilati Pilesa jwa ku Asiliya, ŵasumwile misinda ja Iyoni, Abele Beti Maka, Yanowa, Kedeshi, Hasoli, cilambo ca Giliyadi ni ca Galileya, ni cilambo cosope ca Nafutali. Ŵandu wosope ŵaŵakamwile ukapolo ŵajawile nawo ku Asiliya.",
          "type": "text",
