          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yotamu mwanace jwa Usiya ŵajinjile ucimwene ŵa ku Yuda, mcaka caŵili ca ucimwene wa Peka mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵaliji ni yaka 25 piŵajinjilaga ucimwene, nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka 16 ku Yelusalemu. Mamagwe ŵaliji Yelusha mwanace jwa Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yotamu ŵatesile yindu yakulungamika pameso pa AMBUJE, mpela muŵatendele Usiya babagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ni juŵataŵile cipata ca mbali ja kumpoto cakwinjilila ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Nambo nombe najo nginapasulanya malo gakulambila milungu ja cilendo. Ŵandu ŵaliji ciŵela kutaga mbopesi ni kututumisya ubani pa malo gelego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo masengo gane giŵatesile Yotamu ali mwenye, yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jeleji ja ulamulilo wa Yotamu, AMBUJE ŵamtumisye Lesini mwenye jwa ku Siliya ni Peka mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, kuti akapute ngondo ku cilambo ca Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yotamu ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile ku malembe ga ucimwene ga mu msinda wa Daudi. Nipo Ahasi mwanace jwakwe ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
